  <metadata>
    <name>Helags fork · Storlien vs Undersåker</name>
    <desc>From Helags until the two corridors meet again (west of Olden). Storlien = Lotta &amp; Björn. Undersåker = Erik Hägglund. Storlien 161 km · Undersåker 124 km.</desc>
